## Fixes, one commit each

- `be39202` D-51 — `applyBackup` skips imported rows whose id matches a built-in
  mode (`v1/src/lib/browser/bundle.ts`), red test in `browser-repository.test.ts`.
- `8ee8842` D-52 — new `v1/src/lib/browser/mode-prompt.ts` adapter/resolver;
  `provider.ts` and `router.ts` now pass `brief.modeId` into both prompt lanes.
  A missing or broken mode adds no layer 3, so old prompts stay unchanged.
- `5051c95` D-53 — `PromptInputs` documented as a reserved seam in the
  prompt-assembler PRD-TRD (doc-only).
- `b97fdc6` D-54 — `built-in-modes.test.ts` asserts generated files equal
  authored files plus `isBuiltIn` and the fixed stamp. Proved RED by perturbing
  a generated file, then regenerated.

`docs/drift.md` records all four as Resolved (0 open / 54 resolved); each
affected IMPL has an Open Drift breadcrumb.

